---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HubPageShell from '../components/hub/HubPageShell.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Investigate Further"
  description="Optional next steps after education for New Mexico homeowners."
  hub={true}
  quote="Taking the time to understand a problem is never a wasted step."
>
  <HubPageShell
    title="Investigate Further"
    subhead="Education first. Next steps only if you choose them."
    bannerBlurb="MFRC does not inspect houses or sell repair. If you choose a next step in New Mexico, the options below may be appropriate."
    description="Most visitors get everything they need from the education on this site and never need this page — it's here only for the smaller number of cases where a geotechnical investigation or a repair conversation is the honest next step."
    glance={[
      { label: 'This page', value: 'Optional next step' },
      { label: 'MFRC', value: 'Education only' },
      { label: 'Geotech', value: 'Sandia Geo' },
      { label: 'Repair', value: 'TLS Foundations' },
    ]}
    nav={[
      { id: 'geo', label: 'Geotechnical investigation' },
      { id: 'repair', label: 'Investigating repair' },
    ]}
    topicsStyle="list"
  >
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="geo">Geotechnical investigation</h2>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>Some foundation questions involve conditions below the surface that cannot be understood through visual observation alone.</p>
      <p>Homeowners may choose to consult a licensed geotechnical engineering firm.</p>
      <div class="related-links">
        <a href="https://www.sandiageo.com/" rel="noopener">Sandia Geo →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="repair">Investigating foundation repair</h2>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>If you are considering foundation repair or comparing repair approaches, you may choose to speak with a qualified foundation repair contractor.</p>
      <div class="related-links">
        <a href="https://www.tlsfoundations.com/" rel="noopener">TLS Foundations →</a>
        <a href="/foundation-behavior-in-new-mexico">Foundation behavior in New Mexico →</a>
        <a href="/new-mexico-soil-conditions">New Mexico soil conditions →</a>
        <a href="/start-here">Start Here →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </HubPageShell>
</BaseLayout>
